 hen the knowledge can be used on real hardware/code/measurements without
  following a step-by-step tutorial.\n\nSIMPLE COMPLETION RULE\nFinish th
 e assigned work, then check the learning outcomes below. If you cannot e
 xplain or demonstrate an outcome, write that one concept on a short catc
 h-up list and repair it during the next available review block. No sprea
 dsheet logging is required.
