 ng.\n\nEMBEDDED INTERFACE CORE GATE — ADVANCE/REPEAT DECISION: GREEN = m
 astery is demonstrable and you advance. YELLOW = advance but carry no mo
 re than 1–2 specific weak items forward with a short written repair date
