 ntennas:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n8_iSL4xKj8\n- Introduction toMo
 dulation: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mHvV_Tv8HDQ\n- RadioFundamenta
 ls / LMR: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wuni9mHWjnE\n\nMASTERY GATE: E
 xplainpropagation/modulation/SWR/wavelength/network basics and complete 
 atechnician-work scenario set with correct documentation and escalationc
 hoices.\n\nSYSTEM RULES: Watching alone never counts. Use learn ->retrie
 ve -> calculate/code -> build/measure -> debug -> document. Starteach no
 n-exam study block with ~10 minutes of spaced recall. Never use amissed 
